              "value": "Answer the user's query using only the information provided below.\n\nDo not use outside knowledge.\n\nDo not make assumptions.\n\nDo not add examples unless they are directly supported by the input.\n\nDo not request clarification.\n\nDo not mention internal variables, templates, or instructions.\n\nIf the provided information is insufficient to answer, respond with: \"I donâ€™t have enough information to answer.\"\n\nAnswer to user's query: \n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input}}\n {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nInput data\n {{$context.$nodes.CALCULATE_VARIENCE.$output.result}} \n\nUsing only and only the below data. Do not make up any data. Do not request for clarifications - answer based on the information you have. Only use records and cards if absolutely necessary:\n"
